Done. Added `filterByTags` to `src/bookmarks.ts:7`.

```ts
export function filterByTags(bookmarks: Bookmark[], tags: string[]): Bookmark[] {
  return bookmarks.filter((b) => tags.every((tag) => b.tags.includes(tag)));
}
```

- **AND semantics** via `tags.every(...)` — a bookmark must contain every requested tag.
- **Empty `tags`** short-circuits to `true` for all, so all bookmarks pass through unchanged.
- Mirrors the existing `findByTag` style (`b.tags.includes`).

